'''Valentine Gals''' (バレンタイン ギャルズ, ''Barentain Gyaruzu'', '''Valentine's Day Gals''') is a Seasonal Gacha Event that appears during the [[War on Valentines]] Event. It features 3 new ubers: [[Sweet Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Sweet Aphrodite]], [[First-Love Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|First-Love Myrcia]] and [[Sweet Love Mekako (Uber Rare Cat)|Sweet Love Mekako]]. It also features a new version of [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]], [[Valentine's Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Valentine's Neneko]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
